  "facts": {
    "F1": {
      "id": "F1",
      "text": "The first commit was made on June 26, 2009 by TJ Holowaychuk, titled \"Initial commit\".",
      "sha": "9998490f93d3ad3d56c00d23c0aa13fac41c3f6b",
      "date": "2009-06-26T11:56:18-07:00"
    },
    "F2": {
      "id": "F2",
      "text": "In its first 30 days the repository got 179 commits.",
      "sha": "433b347a7bbddda5b6274ac1e4b5dabd9ed27109",
      "date": "2009-07-21T16:25:07-07:00"
    },
    "F3": {
      "id": "F3",
      "text": "Founder TJ Holowaychuk made 3,881 commits; the last one was on February 19, 2014, \"update node-fresh\".",
      "sha": "6b05f60badd3cf8e88ec46e192703dd5f3d31071",
      "date": "2014-02-19T15:29:39-08:00"
    },
    "F4": {
      "id": "F4",
      "text": "After that, 1,892 more commits were made by others.",
      "sha": "1c6f1b0fe4000977b9a7b4f34097e4d527dd9824",
      "date": "2026-10-23T16:21:08-05:00"
    },
    "F7": {
      "id": "F7",
      "text": "The first tag, 0.0.1, was cut on January 3, 2010, 6 months after the first commit.",
      "sha": "728b64376eb1fd467783fa9fa86d4f20f2a9f710",
      "date": "2010-01-03T05:25:22-08:00"
    },
    "F19": {
      "id": "F19",
      "text": "Version v5.0.0 was tagged on September 9, 2024.",
      "sha": "344b022fc7ed95cf07b46e097935e61151fd585f",
      "date": "2024-09-09T23:37:22-05:00"
    },
    "F20": {
      "id": "F20",
      "text": "That was 10.4 years after 4.0.0.",
      "sha": "344b022fc7ed95cf07b46e097935e61151fd585f",
      "date": "2024-09-09T23:37:22-05:00"
    },
    "F21": {
      "id": "F21",
      "text": "The first 5.x pre-release, 5.0.0-alpha.1, was tagged on November 6, 2014: 9.8 years before the final release.",
      "sha": "4052c15c7f10b79fb7c54f3837ffe118f7a99811",
      "date": "2014-11-06T21:52:29-05:00"
    },
    "F22": {
      "id": "F22",
      "text": "There are 278 tags on the main line of history.",
      "sha": "cf6722bf89a86905281d9160b6482e08166b5ef0",
      "date": "2026-10-09T14:47:46+02:00"
    },
    "F23": {
      "id": "F23",
      "text": "On April 15, 2012, TJ Holowaychuk landed \"removed old docs\": 31 files, +0 and -5,316 lines.",
      "sha": "856f3b3be681bf2c9c955455639eb5e35cc97c36",
      "date": "2012-04-15T19:42:55-07:00"
    },
    "F24": {
      "id": "F24",
      "text": "On July 5, 2010, TJ Holowaychuk landed \"Removed specs\": 53 files, +0 and -4,821 lines.",
      "sha": "f97a222cf54568a25d7a3a25cc3dbb81f243fdc8",
      "date": "2010-07-05T14:50:39-07:00"
    },
    "F25": {
      "id": "F25",
      "text": "The history contains 21 revert commits.",
      "sha": "a419aa7350389a275ab45fde2e849ed1f02449ef",
      "date": "2026-10-09T11:24:38-05:00"
    },
    "F26": {
      "id": "F26",
      "text": "\"add 'etag' option\" by Max Riveiro lasted 22 hours before TJ Holowaychuk reverted it on December 6, 2012.",
      "sha": "9bd86cdddc5f78f37f0c33ba7f094977e7aaf0cb",
      "date": "2012-12-06T15:15:49-08:00"
    },
    "F27": {
      "id": "F27",
      "text": "Between 3:37 p.m. on December 15, 2009 and 4:47 p.m., 7 fix-style commits landed in a row, over 69 minutes.",
      "sha": "7e666845b6b3624121809e563f9152ec1d54d48a",
      "date": "2009-12-15T16:47:28-08:00"
    },
    "F28": {
      "id": "F28",
      "text": "Their messages: \"Fixing specs due to Request change\"; \"Fixing more specs\"; \"Fixed redirect helpers due to Request change\"; \"More specs fixed\"; \"Fixed some cookie specs\".",
      "sha": "7ca59426d273d8a2423e2e27a3f3f39826e56a07",
      "date": "2009-12-15T15:55:07-08:00"
    },
    "F36": {
      "id": "F36",
      "text": "The busiest week began July 12, 2010: 158 commits, against a typical week of 6.",
      "sha": "c4278c81f195434e773bb80265de47509a3784f2",
      "date": "2010-07-16T15:59:06-07:00"
    },
    "F37": {
      "id": "F37",
      "text": "TJ Holowaychuk made 156 of them.",
      "sha": "c4278c81f195434e773bb80265de47509a3784f2",
      "date": "2010-07-16T15:59:06-07:00"
    },
    "F38": {
      "id": "F38",
      "text": "135 commits were committed 30 or more days after they were written: rebased, cherry-picked or amended.",
      "sha": "b8fc000f3116237b2bcc0df41b5b999f95da37ae",
      "date": "2026-01-05T17:46:28-05:00"
    },
    "F39": {
      "id": "F39",
      "text": "Today the history holds 6,183 commits by 386 authors, over 17.3 years.",
      "sha": "1c6f1b0fe4000977b9a7b4f34097e4d527dd9824",
      "date": "2026-10-23T16:21:08-05:00"
    },
    "F40": {
      "id": "F40",
      "text": "Across all of them, 131,031 lines were added and 103,175 deleted, not counting lockfiles and vendored code.",
      "sha": "1c6f1b0fe4000977b9a7b4f34097e4d527dd9824",
      "date": "2026-10-23T16:21:08-05:00"
    },
    "F41": {
      "id": "F41",
      "text": "The latest commit, on October 24, 2026, is \"test: expand coverage for request, response and view behavior (#7112)\" by Bhavya Dhiman.",
      "sha": "1c6f1b0fe4000977b9a7b4f34097e4d527dd9824",
      "date": "2026-10-23T16:21:08-05:00"
    },
